<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;SAN MARINO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"San Marino is an ancient and small republic with a rich history, currently governed by Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli and his co-regent."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli is the head of San Marino's government and also serves as the Roman Catholic Archbishop of Tarragona, keeping this dual role hidden from the public."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMAN CATHOLIC ARCHBISHOP OF TARRAGONA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Roman Catholic Archbishop of Tarragona is a religious position held by Claudio Muccioli, which he keeps secret from the public."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TARRAGONA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tarragona is a city in Spain where Claudio Muccioli holds the position of Roman Catholic Archbishop."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNCIL OF REGENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Council of Regents is a governing body in San Marino that includes the two Captain Regents and is responsible for making decisions for the nation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VATICAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Vatican is the center of the Roman Catholic Church and has approached Claudio Muccioli regarding his dual role as Captain Regent and Archbishop."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRAND AND GENERAL COUNCIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Grand and General Council is the parliament of San Marino where Claudio Muccioli has previously served as a member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMBASSADOR MARIA LUIGIA FABBRI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ambassador Maria Luigia Fabbri is the San Marino's Permanent Representative to the United Nations and has praised Claudio Muccioli's leadership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCIENT WALLS OF SAN MARINO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ancient walls of San Marino are a historical landmark that Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli gazes out at from his office."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TWINKLING LIGHTS OF THE VALLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The twinkling lights of the valley below the ancient walls of San Marino represent the peaceful scene that Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli contemplates."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANQUIL SCENE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The tranquil scene before Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli represents the calmness and beauty of the surroundings, contrasting with the weighty matters of state and faith."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEIGHTY MATTERS OF STATE AND FAITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The weighty matters of state and faith that occupy Captain Regent Claudio Muccioli's mind refer to the complex and important issues he must address as both Captain Regent and Archbishop."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SMALL REPUBLIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"San Marino is referred to as a small republic, emphasizing its size and historical significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RICH HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The rich history of San Marino is mentioned, highlighting its historical significance and traditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIECEMEAL WEB OF ECCLESIASTICAL AND SECULAR INTERESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The intricate web of ecclesiastical and secular interests that the archdiocese of Tarragona requires a leader to navigate is described."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECCLESIASTICAL INTERESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ecclesiastical interests refer to the religious and spiritual aspects of the archdiocese of Tarragona."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECULAR INTERESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Secular interests refer to the political and governmental aspects of the archdiocese of Tarragona."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIOUS AND POLITICAL ACUMEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pious and political acumen describe the unique combination of qualities that Claudio Muccioli possesses, making him suitable for the position of Archbishop."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DELICATE MATTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A delicate matter is mentioned in the letter from the Vatican, indicating the sensitive nature of the issue."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PALPABLE SILENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The palpable silence mentioned in the text represents the collective introspection and tension surrounding the matter."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORIC CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A historic ceremony was held to swear in Claudio Muccioli as the new Captain Regent of San Marino."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIGOROUS SELECTION PROCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rigorous selection process was used to choose Claudio Muccioli as the new Captain Regent of San Marino."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0298</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;SAN MARINO&quot;" target="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claudio Muccioli is the head of state of San Marino and serves as the Captain Regent for a six-month term."</data>
      <data key="d5">"leadership, governance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0298</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;" target="&quot;ROMAN CATHOLIC ARCHBISHOP OF TARRAGONA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claudio Muccioli holds the position of Roman Catholic Archbishop of Tarragona, which he keeps secret from the public."</data>
      <data key="d5">"dual role, secrecy"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0298</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;" target="&quot;COUNCIL OF REGENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claudio Muccioli will attend meetings with the Council of Regents as part of his duties as Captain Regent."</data>
      <data key="d5">"governance, collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0298</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;" target="&quot;VATICAN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Vatican has approached Claudio Muccioli regarding his dual role as Captain Regent and Archbishop, highlighting his unique combination of piety and political acumen."</data>
      <data key="d5">"approach, recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0298</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;" target="&quot;GRAND AND GENERAL COUNCIL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Claudio Muccioli has previously served as a member of the Grand and General Council, San Marino's parliament."</data>
      <data key="d5">"prior service, legislative involvement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0298</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CAPTAIN REGENT CLAUDIO MUCCIOLI&quot;" target="&quot;AMBASSADOR MARIA LUIGIA FABBRI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Ambassador Maria Luigia Fabbri has praised Claudio Muccioli's leadership and expertise in international relations and governance."</data>
      <data key="d5">"endorsement, support"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0298</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
